He spoke, and offered first-offerings to the gods who are forever-born,
and having poured a libation of the fire-faced wine, to Odysseus the city-sacking
in his hands he put it;

And food for them distributed Mesaulius, whom indeed the swineherd
himself acquired, alone, while his lord was away,
apart from his mistress and the old man Laertes;

But when indeed it was in three parts of night, and the stars had passed on,
then I spoke to Odysseus, who was near,
with my elbow having nudged him;

‘Zeus-sprung son of Laertes, many-devising Odysseus,
not any longer, you see, among the living shall I be, but me the cold
subdues;

So he spoke, and up then started Thoas, Andraemon’s son,
speedily, and off his cloak he put, the crimson one,
and he set out to run to the ships;

therefore neither of clothing will you be in want, nor of anything else,
of which it is fitting that a much-tried suppliant, meeting us, should have,
now;

and not to the swineherd
was pleasing the bed there, from the pigs away to sleep,
but he, then, outside going, armed himself;
